  "bookPage1": "<align=center><b>THE USURPER'S DRAUGHT</b></align>\n<i>Restores lost strength and the vigour of youth.</i>\n<b>I.</b> Silvarra and Virelen, beneath the sign of Life.\n<b>II.</b> Moonpetal and … <color=#7a6a55><i>(the corner is torn away)</i></color> … the sign of Dark.\n<b>III.</b> A few drops of young blood, sealed with Gravecup beneath the sign of Blood.\n<i>Never let Mandrake take the place of Gravecup, or the draught will turn upon the one who drinks it.</i>\n<color=#7a6a55><i>(see the notes overleaf)</i></color>",
  "bookPage2": "<b>Notes</b>\nWith the blood of one touched by the Light, the draught does far more than restore youth.\nIt takes the life and power of the one blessed by the Light… but in the one who drinks it, the Light will be corrupted.",
  "allEndingsAchievement": "three_fates",
  "codexOnlyRecipes": [
    "The Usurper's Draught"
  ]
}
